: old control</li>\n<li>old_Dox: old+OSKM(SVZ)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>MULTI_classification_rescued - mouse ID (biological replicate)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><em>Updated 2024/07/01 (v2): replaced a corrupted file.&nbsp;</em></p>", "access_right": "open", "embargo_date": "2024-03-29", "creators": [{"name": "Xu, Lucy", "affiliation": null, "orcid": "0000-0001-6765-463X"}], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "10.1038/s43587-024-00594-3", "relation": "isPublishedIn", "resource_type": "publication-article", "scheme": "doi"}], "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 1, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "10626909"}}]}}, "title": "Processed Seurat objects from scRNA-seq data of the aging subventricular zone (SVZ) neurogenic niche with partial reprogramming", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/12613762", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/12613762", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/12613762?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.12613762", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.12613762", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.12613762", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/12613762/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10626909", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/10626909", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.10626909", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.10626909", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:12613762/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:12613762/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/12613762/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/12613762/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/12613762/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/12613762/latest", "versions": "https://z